@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get All Products (No filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products HTTP/1.1

###

### 2. Get Active Products Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?isActive=true HTTP/1.1

###

### 3. Get Inactive Products Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?isActive=false HTTP/1.1

###

### 4. Filter Products by Price Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?minPrice=50&maxPrice=500 HTTP/1.1

###

### 5. Filter Active Products within Price Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?isActive=true&minPrice=100&maxPrice=300 HTTP/1.1

### 6. Get Product by ID
@productId = bdd01b79-1319-41c1-b7d3-2a61019138d1
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}} HTTP/1.1
